OL,4,G0232FThe Documentary
OL,5,     GBotswana has more elephants than
OL,6,     Gany other country, but it is a
OL,7,     Gburden as well as a blessing.
OL,8,     GElephant conservation is complex
OL,9,     Gand expensive and it can be
OL,10,     Gcontroversial too.
