OL,12,G0306FOutlook
OL,13,     GIf you were sent to prison for a
OL,14,     Gcrime you didn't commit, how many
OL,15,     Gsetbacks could you endure to re-
OL,16,     Ggain your freedom?
OL,17,G0350FWitness History
OL,18,     GSalmon was the one fish the
OL,19,     GJapanese didn't eat raw, but in
OL,20,     Gthe late 1980s a man from Norway
OL,21,     Gwas trying to change that.
